// Title: Potential DLL Sideloading Of DbgModel.DLL
// Rule ID: fef394cd-f44d-4040-9b18-95d92fe278c0
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.persistence, attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1574.001
// Category: image_load
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/image_load/image_load_side_load_dbgmodel.yml
